-- DEMO DATA for local development only. Invented people, shops and requests; every phone number is in the made-up range +670 7000 xxxx. No photos.
-- Loaded by `npm run db:demo` (which clears earlier demo rows and loads the launch lists of categories and areas first) and removed by `npm run db:demo:remove`.
-- Not a migration, so it never reaches production. Marker: every demo phone number starts with +6707000, which is how seeds/demo-remove.sql finds the rows. One statement per line.
